te being good at her job, While at home she lazes around and makes Kouki work hard.\n\nThe second born daughter, Momone: Absolutely adores Kouki, and does nothing but spoil him.\n\nThe third daughter, Saori: She does all the housework, and although she is like a maid she prefers it to going outside.\n\nThe youngest daughter, Anzu: Has no reservation in calling Kouki her personal play toy.\n\nEach of them have their own motives doing anything they can; at times even tempting him into sexual situations, so they can draw closer to making the Kouki they love their husband. If Kouki ever chooses a bride, who will it be? The energetic life with the quartet of sisters is about to begin."},"tags":[{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Large Breasts","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Maids","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boobjob","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fellatio","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cunnilingus","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cosplay","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Hikikomori","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nakadashi","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Facial","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Ane Yome Quartet","english":null,"native":"あねよめカルテット","romaji":"Ane Yome Quartet","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"姐嫁四重奏"}]},"trailer":{"id":"6-WD50YgU0o","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6-WD50YgU0o/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"adult"}